WEBVTT

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:33.131
Some scientists call this
"The Big Brain Bang."

00:00:33.887 --> 00:00:37.018
Others call it "The Great Leap Forward,"

00:00:37.042 --> 00:00:38.196
which I prefer.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:39.648
It's so much more poetic.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:46.607
This is when Homo sapiens began to evolve
into the modern species that we are today.

00:00:47.778 --> 00:00:52.509
The Great Leap Forward activated
most of our modern abilities:

00:00:52.533 --> 00:00:55.069
abstract thought, planning,

00:00:56.124 --> 00:00:58.487
cooking, competitive labor,

00:00:58.511 --> 00:01:01.574
language, art, music